    "title": "Anchorage preparing for AAPI Heritage Month celebration at Delaney Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nathan Espindula, Your Alaska Link ,\n7 hours ago Anchorage is getting ready to celebrate Asian American and Pacific Islander Heritage Month with a free community event this weekend at Delaney Park Strip. The celebration will take place on Saturday from noon to 6 p.m. and will feature cultural performances, traditional dances, and the raising of national flags. Organizers... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
